"The Enchantment of the Forgetful Traveler makes a satchel likelier to return to its owner."
"The enchantment is extremely tedious and notoriously difficult to set."
"Reunion grows likelier as the bag grows attached; it is put on bags sturdy enough for a lifetime."
"Theft may strengthen or weaken the bag's attachment, depending on the thief's method."
"Bags rank by age and attachment; Eternally Loyal Century Bags teleport home within hours."
"A Society for the Study and Admiration of Forgetful Traveler's Objects meets yearly in Vethedya."
"The Society is split on whether owners who did not enchant their bags are enthusiasts or posers."
